  "translation": "Na man i bosim ⟨i⟩ haus, na man i bosim ⟨i⟩ siti, na ol olpela man, na ol man i lukautim ol pikinini, ol i salim tok long Yehu, i tok olsem: Mipela ⟨i⟩ ol wokboi bilong yu, na olgeta samting yu tok long mipela, mipela bai mekim; mipela no ken kirapim man i kamap king; gutpela samting long ai bilong yu, yu mekim.",
